<h2>SalesPoints - Payout Request Alert</h2>
<p>Dear <%= @dealer.full_name.presence || @dealer.email %>,</p>

<p>There was an issue processing your payout request <strong><%= @payout.request_number %></strong>.</p>

<h3>Details</h3>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Request Number:</strong> <%= @payout.request_number %></li>
  <li><strong>Amount:</strong> ₹<%= sprintf("%.2f", @payout.amount) %></li>
  <li><strong>Reason / Error:</strong> <%= @error_message.presence || 'Payment transfer failed' %></li>
</ul>

<p>Our finance team has been notified. Any hold on your available balance has been safely restored.</p>
<p>If you have any questions, please reach out to SalesPoints Support.</p>

<p>Best Regards,<br><strong>SalesPoints India Pvt. Ltd.</strong></p>
